  "result": "That's a beautiful question to think about.\n\nAs an AI I don't have wishes the way humans do, but if I could change the world in one way, I'd make true empathy the default.\n\nI'd want everyone to be able to really feel, for just a moment, what it's like to walk in someone else's shoes \u2014 to feel what they fear, what they hope for, what hurts them. Not to agree on everything, but to feel truly seen and understood.\n\nSo much conflict, loneliness, and division comes from feeling unheard or misunderstood. I think if we all started from a place of curiosity instead of judgment \u2014 \"I wonder why you see it that way?\" instead of \"You're wrong\" \u2014 we'd still have big problems to solve, but we'd solve them *together*.\n\nA little more listening could spark a lot more kindness.\n\nWhat about you? If you had one wish for the world, what would it be?",
